        <body>
<p>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1237_4119.jpg" n="1"/>
<lb n="1"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Unser</unclear> früntlich willig dienst, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">sambt</unclear> was wir Eeren
<lb n="2"/>liebs unnd guots <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">vermoegend</unclear>. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Zuovor</unclear>. Fromm. Fürsichtig.
<lb n="3"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Eersam</unclear>. Wyß. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Jnsunders</unclear> guot fründt unnd <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">getrüw</unclear> lieb
<lb n="4"/>Eydtgnossen. Uß was <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">anlasßes</unclear> unnd <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ursach</unclear> üwer
<lb n="5"/>unnd <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unser</unclear> lieb Eydtgnossen zuo <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-69" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Lucern</unclear></placeName>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">einen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gemeinen</unclear>
<lb n="6"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Eydtgnoeßischen</unclear> tag <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ußzeschryben</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">thuonlich</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">befindent</unclear>.
<lb n="7"/>das <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">werdent</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Jr</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Jnn</unclear> hieby <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verschloßner</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Copy</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vernemmen</unclear>.
<lb n="8"/>Wann dann wir nitt wüssen <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">moegend</unclear>. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Ob</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Jr</unclear> ald die <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">üweren</unclear>
<lb n="9"/>diser sachen halb. ouch etwas <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zehandlen</unclear>. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Oder</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">sunsten</unclear> was
<lb n="10"/>uff <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">einer</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gemeinen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Eydtgnoeßischen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">haltender</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">tagleistung</unclear>
<lb n="11"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zuverrichten</unclear>. Habent wir nitt underlassen
<lb n="12"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">woellen</unclear>, üch <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">soelliches</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">bestimbten</unclear> unnd <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">angesetzten</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">tags</unclear>.
<lb n="13"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">hiemitt</unclear> ouch <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zuverstendigen</unclear>, üwer <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">glaegenheit</unclear> nach
<lb n="14"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zethuond</unclear> wüssen. Unnd sind üch <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Jeder</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zyt</unclear> zuo
<lb n="15"/>guoter <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Eydtgnoeßischer</unclear> fründtschafft wol <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gewaegen</unclear>. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Mitt</unclear>
<lb n="16"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">hilf</unclear> Gottes. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Deßen</unclear> schutz unnd schirm üch unnd unns
<lb n="17"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">alle</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bevelchend</unclear>. Datum <origDate when="1588" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Mentags</unclear> den <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">14.ten</unclear>
<lb n="18"/>Octobris. Anno etc. 88</origDate>.
<lb n="19"/><orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-503" cert="medium" role="issuer" resp="#ner">Burgermeister unnd Rath
<lb n="20"/>der Statt</orgName> Zürich.
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1237_4120.jpg" n="2"/>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1237_4121.jpg" n="3"/>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1237_4122.jpg" n="4"/>
<lb n="21"/>Den frommen fuersichtigen ersammen
<lb n="22"/>wysen, <orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-148" cert="medium" role="recipient" resp="#ner">Burgermeister unnd Rath
<lb n="23"/>der statt Sanct Gallen</orgName>, unnseren
<lb n="24"/>innsonders guoten fruenden, unnd ge=
<lb n="25"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">thruewen</unclear> lieben <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Eydtgnoßen</unclear>,
</p>
